# `use pixi` with no version, for the unpinned-directive job in direnv-upgrade-pixi-test.yml.
#
# This .envrc does not load at all - use_pixi requires a fully qualified version and fails
# on this - so the action must say that rather than invent a pin for it. Same file as
# direnv/setup's fixture-pixi-unpinned, tested here from the other side.
use pixi
